  "prefLabel": "Mtec 208.02 Action on Petitions for Declaratory Rulings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 208.02 Action on Petitions for Declaratory Rulings.\n\n(a) The board shall issue a decision on the request for a declaratory ruling, in writing, within 90 days of receipt of a petition.\n\n(b) A copy of each written decision on a request for declaratory ruling shall be:\n\n(1) Filed with the director of legislative services;\n\n(2) Sent to the petitioner by first class mail; and\n\n(3) Filed with the board.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec200.html"
